      "seed": 1240840643,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255073115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 2201.4,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684561670,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1825831334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795360018465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 现有记忆系统不断堆叠抽取、冲突覆写、反思、知识图谱等重型原语，但缺乏极简强基线检验这些高成本模块是否真有净收益；\n2. 现有基准（LoCoMo / LongMemEval）只测“能不能答出关于过去的问题（召回）”，却不测“新任务不提旧规则时，Agent 能否自觉应用记住的规则与模式（执行）”。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 现有记忆系统不断堆叠抽取、冲突覆写、反思、知识图谱等重型原语，但缺乏极简强基线检验这些高成本模块是否真有净收益；\n2. 现有基准（LoCoMo / LongMemEval）只测“能不能答出关于过去的问题（召回）”，却不测“新任务不提旧规则时，Agent 能否自觉应用记住的规则与模式（执行）”。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
